SUMMARY:Winter Gravel Series (Blue Wheel Bicycles) — Charlottesville\, 
 VA (time on the host's page)
LOCATION:Varies by ride; Nov 15 at Fleetwood Community Center\, Massies M
 ill\, VA
DESCRIPTION:Pace: Intermediate and above; self-sufficient riders.\nSchedu
 le: Seven Sundays\, November to March: Nov 15 (Fleetwood Community Cente
 r\, Massies Mill VA; 9am for 75mi\, 10am for 50mi\, 11am for 25mi)\, Dec
  6 (Three Notch'd Brewery\, Nelson County)\, Dec 27 (Xmas Wild Card — 
 destination TBA)\, Jan 17 (Stony Point — Southwest Mountain Vineyards)
 \, Feb 7 (Free Union — Tiffin Farm)\, Feb 28 (Rocktown Bicycles)\, Mar
  21 (Series Finale — Love Ridge Mountain Lodging).\nConfirm with the h
 ost before you go.\nhttps://cycleforchange.org/rides/charlottesville-va-
 blue-wheel-winter-gravel-series/
